# zdev projects — one path per line, relative to $WORKSPACE (~/workspace).
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Append ' *' to mark a project as a favorite, e.g.:
#   zitcha/backend *
# Favorites are started by `zdev up` and skipped by `zdev reap`.
